The Gondolier was flung into the canal when [[Lok Lambert]] tried to escape from [[DeFoe|DeFoe's]] [[Suits]] and their [[Titans]] by jumping into a gondola. The gondolier, terrified by the sight of the Titans, later ran into DeFoe, telling him in a panick that monsters were in the canal. DeFoe used a [[Touchram]] and [[Simplemind]] spell on him to knock out the gondolier and make him forget this event.<br />{{source|A Seeker Is Born}}

Through a similar event, Lok Lambert and [[Den Fears]] knocked the gondolier into the canal when trying to escape from a group of the [[Blood Spiral Brotherhood|Blood Spiral's]] [[Silent Soldiers]]. When the gondolier resurfaced, he saw the Silent Soldiers use their magical powers, and he dived underwater again. {{source|Boys Will Be Seekers}}

